{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person horror adventure where you must escape while being pursued by a mysterious giant hamburger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a creepy facility and stand your ground against the approaching menace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Key Features]</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Fight with fries...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice your enemies with a glowing French fry! It's the only way to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read your enemy\u2019s moves, guard when needed, and strike during openings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a lock-on system, so even players not confident with camera control can fight comfortably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>May the M.O.R.S.E. be with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">M.O.R.S.E. (Move Or Rotate Spatial Elements) is an ability that lets you move or levitate objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use it to clear paths, solve puzzles, and aid your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What exactly is that giant hamburger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you push deeper into the facility, you'll gradually uncover its identity and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss the shocking finale!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Volume</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed for about 1 to 2 hours of playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story is self-contained with no branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Streaming and Video Policy]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We welcome gameplay videos and streaming. Please follow these two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Include the name of this game in your video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add a link to the game\u2019s Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648240?t=1745140238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648240?t=1745140238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648240/632d35059d4fb6df7c5e17f38f57fdec03940ae8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745140238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648240/632d35059d4fb6df7c5e17f38f57fdec03940ae8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745140238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person horror adventure where you must escape while being pursued by a mysterious giant hamburger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a creepy facility and stand your ground against the approaching menace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Key Features]</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Fight with fries...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice your enemies with a glowing French fry! It's the only way to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read your enemy\u2019s moves, guard when needed, and strike during openings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a lock-on system, so even players not confident with camera control can fight comfortably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>May the M.O.R.S.E. be with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">M.O.R.S.E. (Move Or Rotate Spatial Elements) is an ability that lets you move or levitate objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use it to clear paths, solve puzzles, and aid your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What exactly is that giant hamburger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you push deeper into the facility, you'll gradually uncover its identity and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss the shocking finale!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Volume</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed for about 1 to 2 hours of playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story is self-contained with no branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Streaming and Video Policy]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We welcome gameplay videos and streaming. Please follow these two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Include the name of this game in your video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add a link to the game\u2019s Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","developers":["lemorion_1224"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648240/1a9ecee753c5476411515395a900a0ff0acebf25/header.jpg?t=1745140238","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126321/movie480.mp4?t=1744728704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126321/movie_max.mp4?t=1744728704"},"name":"deathburger","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126321/3a91713b2fc490399c5efa4da9e7112b30b28ff1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744728704","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126321/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744728704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126321/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744728704"}}],"name":"DEATH BURGER","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit.<br></